  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Jupiter.Runtime::Jupiter.World.Readable
  title: Crew medical summary (H. Mori)
  body: 'CONAMARA EXPEDITION: CREW MEDICAL SUMMARY


    ASHFORD, Daniel R.  Commander.  DOB 17 04 2131.  Bone density -3.1%. Sleeping four hours a night; declines sedatives.

    FERREIRA, Luca.  Pilot.  DOB 02 11 2149.  Excellent. Complains about everything, which I take as a vital sign.

    LINDQVIST, Mara.  Engineer.  DOB 29 08 2147.  Fit. Has stopped coming to her psych check-ins.

    MORI, Hana.  Medical officer.  Self-assessment: tired.

    OKAFOR, Samuel.  Geophysicist.  DOB 05 06 2144.  Recurring dream about the ice. Logged at his request.


    Note to self: ask the Commander why the sample freezer in the lab was rated for biological material.'
  setsFlag: read_crew_medical
